### Additional information

- The **Remove Right Of Use** action, available from the Goods section of the contract, allows unlinking the fixed asset from the good without deleting the fixed asset itself, for example in case of an incorrect assignment. Confirmation is requested before proceeding.
- If the fixed asset is instead deleted through standard fixed asset management, the link on the good is cleared automatically.